# OAuth 2.0 Credentials Template
# 
# To set up Google Sheets integration, you need to:
# 1. Create OAuth 2.0 credentials in Google Cloud Console
# 2. Copy the Client ID and Client Secret to config.ini
#
# Steps:
# 1. Go to https://console.cloud.google.com/
# 2. Create a new project or select existing one
# 3. Enable Google Sheets API
# 4. Go to APIs & Services > Credentials
# 5. Create OAuth client ID (Desktop application)
# 6. Copy Client ID and Client Secret
# 7. Add them to config.ini under [GoogleSheets] section
#
# Example config.ini:
# [GoogleSheets]
# ClientId=your_client_id_here
# ClientSecret=your_client_secret_here
# DocumentId=your_google_sheet_id_here
# SheetName=Guild Roster
